\n- Add the Linux single-file install path: glibc aarch64/x86_64 build, Bubblewrap requirement, startup commands, common options, SSH port forwarding, and sandbox/token troubleshooting.\n- Shorten the core and domain page titles. Sidebar labels are taken from each page's H1, so the long descriptive titles made the navigation unwieldy.\n- Link `plant-growth.csv` where the walkthrough asks readers to upload it, and rename two headings that promised more than the step delivers.\n\n## Why\nThe old getting-started group asked readers to pick among six short pages before they had seen the product work. One install page plus one walkthrough exercises Agent loops, tools, Skills, Specialists, workspaces and artifacts in a single pass, and the Linux path is now documented next to Windows.\n\n## Checks\n- Rebased onto `0961289a` (current `openJiuwen-ai:main`); merge-base is `0961289a` and the PR has no conflicts.\n- `node scripts/check-doc-links.mjs`: 138 Markdown files checked, 0 dangling links.\n- Docs tree after the change: EN 67 / ZH 66 pages, no duplicate H1.\n- Removed the six per-language getting-started pages; every remaining reference to them is updated in this PR.\n- Docs-only change: the `release:docs` label applies. Contributors cannot add labels, so a maintainer or the gate bot needs to apply it.\r\n\r\n## Identity\nAuthor and committer: nanzhaogang <42226610+nanzhaogang@users.noreply.github.com>","ci":{"checks":[{"conclusion":"success","name":"Select CI policy","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/41019366963/job/123942931854"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"L1 (static checks)","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/41019366963/job/123942998757"},{"conclusion":"skipped","name":"L4/L5 real E2E","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/41019366963/job/123943000710"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"Freeze mocked E2E matrix","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencedis