[draft PR run](https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/41027025696): policy and L1 static checks passed; UT/ST/mocked E2E were skipped while the PR was draft.\n- Local `pnpm ci:l1`: dependency installation completed, but the shared runner failed before test execution with `spawn pnpm ENOENT` on Windows. No local L1 case totals are claimed.\n- Local UT/ST/mocked E2E: blocked by unavailable Linux CI prerequisites on this Windows host (including `uv` and the Linux sandbox). No executed/passed case totals are claimed. The platform-tagged workflow regression files register no cases on Windows, so their file-level success is not counted as coverage.\n- Live real-model execution: not run; upstream Environment credentials are required.\n\n## E2E user journeys\n\nNot applicable to product journeys: this change only switches the GitHub Actions Environment used by existing real-model jobs and updates matching documentation.\n\n## Release\n\nRelease category: release:internal\nUser impact: CI configuration only.\nCompatibility and migration: the target repository must retain the existing `nightly-ci-ds` Environment with the required model/judge variables and secrets.\n","ci":{"checks":[{"conclusion":"success","name":"Select CI policy","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/41027025696/job/123967450034"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"Select CI policy","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/41027342620/job/123968478593"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"L1 (static checks)","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/41027025696/job/123967534104"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"L1 (static checks)","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/41027342620/job/123968566149"},{"conclusion":"skipped","name":"L4/L5 real E2E","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/41027025696/job/123967536255"},{"conclusion":"skipped","na